  "intro": {
    "en": "This edition includes 7 reviewed and approved papers: Harness RSI: 6; Evaluation, benchmarks & attribution: 1. Harness RSI has the most papers in this edition. Reviewed and published late on Nov 18: two papers belong to the actual Nov 16 HF recommendation list, and five come from the true other-source window. MIRIX was discovered earlier and is being published here for the first time. Collection and review dates remain explicit.",
    "source": "count-template",
