      "short_title": "Evaluation-Free Recursive Self-Improvement for Coding Agents",
      "source_hits": [
        "s2-citations"
      ],
      "summary_en": "ELITE integrates independently proposed code mechanisms into an executable agent and admits descendants through compilation and execution-protocol checks. The loop uses no downstream task scores, and accepted changes can still fluctuate in performance.",
      "summary_zh": "ELITE 将并行提出的代码机制整合进可执行代理，并以编译和执行协议检查决定下一代；环内不使用下游任务成绩，已接受修改也可能出现性能波动。",
      "title": "Evaluation-Free Recursive Self-Improvement for Coding Agents",
      "updated": "2026-11-16T13:05:46Z",
