      "short_title": "RemeshingAgent",
      "source_hits": [
        "s2-citations"
      ],
      "summary_en": "RemeshingAgent revises executable pipeline templates and skill instructions from mesh-repair trajectories, replacing the incumbent only after held-out selection improves and testing separately. Its tool-expansion experiment produced no adopted new operator.",
      "summary_zh": "RemeshingAgent 从网格修复轨迹修改可执行流水线模板和技能指令，只有留出选择集改善才替换当前技能，并另作测试；工具算子扩展实验未产生被采用的新算子。",
      "title": "RemeshingAgent: An Iterative Agent for Repair-Based Decimation of Generated Building Meshes",
      "updated": "2026-11-16T05:08:27Z",
      "version": 1,
      "week": "2026-W47",
