      "short_title": "Synapse",
      "source_hits": [
        "s2-citations"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Synapse repairs natural-language skills using execution traces to locate faults and typed patches to rewrite skill source, with a separate validation suite selecting retained versions. Acceptance requires an improved overall pass rate, not preservation of every previously passing case.",
      "summary_zh": "Synapse 以程序修复方式修改自然语言技能：执行轨迹定位问题，类型化补丁写回技能，再由独立验证集选择保留。接受依据是整体通过率提升，并不保证每个旧样例都不退化。",
      "title": "Synapse: Optimizing Natural-Language Agent Skills through Program Repair",
