      "short_title": "WeVisForensics",
      "source_hits": [
        "s2-citations"
      ],
      "summary_en": "WeVisForensics updates both visual-inspector weights and reusable reporting rules. Rule revisions must improve judgments on held-out recent calls without losing previously correct judgments before publication to subsequent rounds. The visual OCR consistency inspector also trains, while audio tools and the PaddleOCR detector remain fixed.",
      "summary_zh": "WeVisForensics 同时更新视觉检查器权重和可复用的报告规则；规则修订须在近期留出调用上改善判断并保留既有正确判断，再发布到后续轮次。视觉 OCR 一致性检查器也参与训练；音频工具和 PaddleOCR 检测器保持固定。",
      "title": "WeVisForensics: Self-Evolving Agent for Omni AI-Generated Video Detection",
      "updated": "2026-11-16T16:36:14Z",
